1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,727
It's here at pier head that you can also catch a boat to the isle of man if you want to.
就在 Pier Head，你还可以乘船去马恩岛，如果你想去的话。

2
00:00:06,447 --> 00:00:09,567
And go on one of the most famous boats in the country.
也可以乘坐他所说的全国最有名的船只之一。

3
00:00:10,767 --> 00:00:17,050
These are the mersey ferries and they'll take you on a boat ride and a sightseeing tour around liverpool's waters.
这些就是默西河渡轮，可以带你乘船游览利物浦水域。

4
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:22,654
These boats are so famous that there's even a famous pop song named after them.
他说，这些船名气很大，甚至有一首著名流行歌以它们命名。

5
00:00:22,654 --> 00:00:26,127
And you do get some wonderful views of the city from here.
而且从这里确实能欣赏到漂亮的城市景色。

6
00:00:27,207 --> 00:00:31,607
You'll notice when you're walking around the city these strange things.
你在城里走时，会注意到这些奇特的东西。

7
00:00:31,607 --> 00:00:37,749
These are super lambananas a kind of cross between a lamb and a banana hence the name.
这些叫 Super Lambananas，像是羔羊和香蕉的结合体，因此有了这个名字。

8
00:00:37,749 --> 00:00:41,247
But there's apparently about 125 of them dotted around the city.
据他说，城里似乎分布着大约一百二十五个。

9
00:00:41,247 --> 00:00:44,847
And this one looks like it's been sat on quite a lot.
这一个看起来像是经常被人坐在上面。

10
00:00:44,847 --> 00:00:53,023
Once you get bored of looking at super lambananas you'll find this oddly shaped building the museum of liverpool.
看够这些雕塑之后，你会发现这座造型奇特的建筑——利物浦博物馆。

11
00:00:53,023 --> 00:00:59,667
It's a free of charge museum that you can go into to learn the history about the city of liverpool.
他说，这是一座免费博物馆，可以进去了解利物浦的历史。

12
00:00:59,667 --> 00:01:06,235
It's actually quite a decent exhibit and you'll get to learn a lot about the history of the city.
他觉得展览确实不错，你能学到不少这座城市的历史。

13
00:01:06,235 --> 00:01:13,381
Especially about the actual size of the port of liverpool which is huge and is connected by several railways.
尤其能了解到利物浦港实际有多大；他说港口很大，还有几条铁路相连。

14
00:01:13,381 --> 00:01:19,411
Inside you'll also find another super lambanana let me just pick the nose of this one.
里面还有另一个 Super Lambanana。让我来抠一下它的鼻子。

15
00:01:19,411 --> 00:01:22,803
Okay good now we can go on the top floor.
好了，不错。现在我们可以上顶层了。

16
00:01:22,803 --> 00:01:28,806
You also get this amazing window view of the three graces so it's an excellent photo opportunity.
这里还能从窗边欣赏三美神建筑的精彩景色，所以很适合拍照。

17
00:01:28,806 --> 00:01:34,128
The city of liverpool is named after this thing here the liver bird.
作者接着说，利物浦这座城市是以这里这个东西——利物鸟——命名的。

18
00:01:34,128 --> 00:01:40,707
But it's actually a mythical creature and people debate all the time as to what kind of bird a liver bird is.
不过，它其实是一种神话生物，人们总在争论利物鸟究竟是哪一种鸟。

19
00:01:41,727 --> 00:01:47,367
I personally believe it's a cormorant which is this thing here but a lot of people may say different things.
我个人觉得是鸬鹚，也就是这里这只，但很多人可能会有不同说法。

20
00:01:47,367 --> 00:01:53,247
Once you leave the museum of liverpool you'll come across more super lambananas you know just because.
离开利物浦博物馆，你又会遇到更多 Super Lambananas——你知道，就因为有嘛。

21
00:01:53,247 --> 00:01:59,028
But you'll also notice that the super modern is mixed with the super ancient.
但你也会发现，特别现代的东西和非常古老的东西混在一起。

22
00:01:59,028 --> 00:02:05,067
So everywhere you go around the city you'll find old stuff mixed together with modern architecture.
所以在城里走到哪儿，你都会发现老东西和现代建筑相互交织。

23
00:02:05,967 --> 00:02:11,914
And it's pretty cool just to walk around and experience some of the history that this city has to offer.
他觉得，在这里随意走走、感受这座城市的历史，就很有意思。

24
00:02:11,914 --> 00:02:17,814
And then disappear into a modern eatery and enjoy a nice drink in the sun.
然后走进一家现代餐馆，在阳光下喝杯好喝的饮料。

25
00:02:17,814 --> 00:02:23,127
Everywhere around pier head is very historical and there's lots of things to explore and take pictures of.
Pier Head 周边很有历史感，还有许多可以探索、拍照的东西。

26
00:02:23,127 --> 00:02:28,791
It's also now home to all of these love locks that adorn most of the dock.
现在这里还出现了这些爱情锁，装点着码头的大部分区域。

27
00:02:28,791 --> 00:02:36,400
So very similar to what you'll find in paris people declare their undying love lock it up and literally throw the keys into the river mersey.
和巴黎能看到的情况很像，人们宣告永恒的爱，把锁锁上，然后把钥匙扔进默西河。

28
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:39,867
And you'll find this pretty much all the way along the docks here.
他说，沿着这里的码头，差不多一路都能看到这些锁。

29
00:02:41,067 --> 00:02:48,323
Whilst we're speaking of docks liverpool is home to some very famous docks the prince's dock the king's dock.
说到码头，利物浦有一些很著名的码头，包括 Prince's Dock 和 King's Dock。

30
00:02:48,323 --> 00:02:55,938
But possibly the most important and most famous of them all is this one the royal albert dock.
但其中最重要、最著名的大概就是这个——皇家阿尔伯特码头。

31
00:02:55,938 --> 00:03:01,283
Traditionally this is the place where all the goods would enter from overseas.
过去，这里是来自海外的货物进入的地方。

32
00:03:01,283 --> 00:03:05,920
And this particular dock was known as the fastest dock in the world.
作者说，这个码头当年被称为世界上最快的码头。

33
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:12,036
With goods and services being exchanged at three times the speed of any other dock in the world.
他说，货物和服务的交换速度，是世界上任何其他码头的三倍。

34
00:03:12,036 --> 00:03:15,447
It is effectively the 1800 s version of amazon prime.
实际上，他把它比作十九世纪版本的 Amazon Prime。

35
00:03:16,947 --> 00:03:21,909
And it's here at the royal albert dock that you'll find the tate modern which is a modern art gallery.
就在皇家阿尔伯特码头，他说你能找到 Tate Modern，一家现代艺术馆。

36
00:03:21,909 --> 00:03:27,381
Modern art is generally not my thing so I've only ever been in this one time.
现代艺术通常不是我喜欢的，所以我只进去过这一次。

37
00:03:27,381 --> 00:03:31,329
It's a nice place to walk around and just feel the history.
这里很适合走走，感受一下历史。

38
00:03:31,329 --> 00:03:38,367
You'll come across some very quaint looking shops that'll sell you various trinkets and traditional things like english toffee and english sweets.
你会遇到一些古色古香的小店，出售各种小饰物和传统食品，比如英式太妃糖和糖果。

39
00:03:39,147 --> 00:03:42,789
You'll also find places that will serve world famous fish and chips.
你也会找到供应世界闻名的炸鱼薯条的地方。

40
00:03:42,789 --> 00:03:49,467
And it's nice to just walk around have a look at the boats and have a look at the architecture of this historic dock.
而且在这里走走、看看船，再欣赏这座历史悠久的码头建筑，也很舒服。

41
00:03:50,667 --> 00:03:59,320
It's also home to the beatles story so if you're a fan of the fabulous 4 this is the main beatles attraction here in the city.
这里还有 Beatles Story。如果你是披头士四人的歌迷，他说这就是城里主要的披头士景点。

42
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:03,190
It definitely comes highly recommended especially if you're into the beatles.
他非常推荐这里，尤其是你喜欢披头士的话。
